  "claims": [
    "EO 1008 gives CIAC original and exclusive jurisdiction over construction contract disputes in the Philippines when the parties agree to voluntary arbitration.",
    "Covered dispute examples include specifications, agreement terms, contractual interpretation, damages and penalties, delays, defects, payment default, and changes in contract cost.",
    "Employer-employee disputes are excluded from EO 1008 coverage.",
    "CIAP Document 102 contract language deems parties submitting to CIAC jurisdiction for disputes arising out of or connected with the contract."
  ],
